# All markdown files are ignored by default -- default-deny, not a blocklist. A new internal *.md
# doc (spec/audit/status/report/whatever any session names it) from any concurrent session is
# excluded automatically, with nothing to remember to add by name. To publish a .md file, add an
# explicit `!path/to/file.md` line below -- each one is a deliberate, individual decision, not a
# directory-level blanket allow (so a new file dropped into results/ etc. doesn't become public
# just by being in the right folder).
*.md

# --- Whitelisted (public) markdown files ---
!README.md
!LOCAL_QUICKSTART.md
!results/ariane133/ariane133_stock_flow.md
!results/ariane133/ariane133_vs_stock.md
!results/figures_data/MANIFEST.md
